    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d216">

                <pb facs="0413" n="317" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg317"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Sherman to Mr. White.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-02-02"><hi rendition="#italic">February 2,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Does the prohibition cover fruit from American Hemisphere or only from the United
                    States, and all kinds of fruit?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sherman.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
